里没什么。快走吧。”\", \"cd344abbce91\"]]"},{"name":"until","type":"string","value":"15-s5"},{"name":"face","type":"string","value":"S"}]},{"id":44,"name":"npc-2","type":"npc","x":72.0,"y":78.4,"width":0,"height":0,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"point":true,"properties":[{"name":"kind","type":"string","value":"folk.soldier"},{"name":"sprite","type":"string","value":"f_soldier"},{"name":"wander","type":"bool","value":false},{"name":"drawn","type":"bool","value":true},{"name":"say","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"A man sits on a sack with an axe across his knees, and stares at you.\", \"一个人坐在麻袋上，斧头横在膝盖上，直盯着你。\", \"c5930a892800\"]]"},{"name":"until","type":"string","value":"15-s5"},{"name":"face","type":"string","value":"E"}]},{"id":45,"name":"npc-3","type":"npc","x":200.0,"y":78.4,"width":0,"height":0,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"point":true,"properties":[{"name":"kind","type":"string","value":"folk.soldier"},{"name":"sprite","type":"string","value":"f_soldier"},{"name":"wander","type":"bool","value":false},{"name":"drawn","type":"bool","value":true},{"name":"say","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"Three more men stand against the wall. None of them moves.\", \"还有三个人靠墙站着，谁也不动。\", \"f3bfbb2f65d8\"]]"},{"name":"until","type":"string","value":"15-s5"},{"name":"face","type":"string","value":"W"}]},{"id":46,"name":"exit-sweet-dew-temple","type":"exit","x":224,"y":96,"width":16,"height":32,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"properties":[{"name":"to","type":"string","value":"sweet-dew-temple"},{"name":"side","type":"string","value":"E"}]},{"id":47,"name":"entry-sweet-dew-temple","type":"entry","x":216.0,"y":110.4,"width":0,"height":0,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"point":true,"properties":[{"name":"from","type":"string","value":"sweet-dew-temple"}]},{"id":48,"name":"entry","type":"entry","x":216.0,"y":110.4,"width":0,"height":0,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"point":true}]}]}